[
  {"comment": "SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT. Shell with faces of their own wall thickness (mitcad#2443, GitHub #642's second request): face_thicknesses in the shell's definition. Each case a 60 x 40 x 20 block (a sketch with lines c1..c4 and its extrusion) shelled with its top open and its bottom at a thickness of its own; the walls measured, the volumes exact."},

  {"comment": "Inside: Sketch1 F1 (d1, d2), Extrude1 F2 (d3), Shell1 F3 2 mm inside (d4), the bottom 5 mm (d5). The cavity is 56 x 36 from z = 5 to the top."},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_rectangle", "sketch": "F1", "corner": [0, 0], "width": 60, "height": 40},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "extrude",
    "profiles": [{"sketch": "F1", "region": "r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]}"}],
    "extent": {"type": "distance", "distance": 20}, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "shell", "body": "F2.b0",
    "faces": ["F2:end(r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]})"], "inside": 2,
    "face_thicknesses": [{"faces": ["F2:start(r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]})"], "inside": 5}]}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Shell1", "status": "ok", "bodies": 1, "body": "Body1", "volume": 17760, "faces": 11,
    "has_face": "F3:offset(F2:start(r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]}))"}},
  {"expect": {"parameter": "d4", "value": 2}},
  {"expect": {"parameter": "d5", "value": 5}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "measure", "a": "Body1/F2:start(r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]})",
    "b": "Body1/F3:offset(F2:start(r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]}))"},
    "result": {"between": {"offset": 5}}}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "measure", "a": "Body1/F2:side(c1[c4,c2])", "b": "Body1/F3:offset(F2:side(c1[c4,c2]))"},
    "result": {"between": {"offset": 2}}}},

  {"comment": "Editing the bottom's thickness (4 mm) and the shell's (3 mm) rebuilds: 56 x 36 x 16, then 54 x 34 x 16."},
  {"cmd": "set_parameter", "name": "d5", "value": 4},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Shell1", "status": "ok", "body": "Body1", "volume": 15744}},
  {"cmd": "set_parameter", "name": "d4", "value": 3},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Shell1", "status": "ok", "body": "Body1", "volume": 18624}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "measure", "a": "Body1/F2:start(r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]})",
    "b": "Body1/F3:offset(F2:start(r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]}))"},
    "result": {"between": {"offset": 4}}}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "measure", "a": "Body1/F2:side(c1[c4,c2])", "b": "Body1/F3:offset(F2:side(c1[c4,c2]))"},
    "result": {"between": {"offset": 3}}}},

  {"comment": "Outside: Sketch2 F4, Extrude2 F5, Shell2 F6 2 mm outside, the bottom 5 mm: the block grown 2 mm round its sides and 5 mm down, less the block. The outside keeps the face names; the block's own bottom is the inside of the wall."},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_rectangle", "sketch": "F4", "corner": [100, 0], "width": 60, "height": 40},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "extrude",
    "profiles": [{"sketch": "F4", "region": "r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]}"}],
    "extent": {"type": "distance", "distance": 20}, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "shell", "body": "F5.b0",
    "faces": ["F5:end(r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]})"], "outside": 2,
    "face_thicknesses": [{"faces": ["F5:start(r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]})"], "outside": 5}]}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Shell2", "status": "ok", "body": "Body2", "volume": 22400}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "measure", "a": "Body2/F5:start(r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]})",
    "b": "Body2/F6:offset(F5:start(r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]}))"},
    "result": {"between": {"offset": 5}}}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "measure", "a": "Body2/F5:side(c1[c4,c2])", "b": "Body2/F6:offset(F5:side(c1[c4,c2]))"},
    "result": {"between": {"offset": 2}}}},

  {"comment": "Both: Sketch3 F7, Extrude3 F8, Shell3 F9 1 mm inside and 1 mm outside, the bottom 3 inside and 2 outside (5 mm)."},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_rectangle", "sketch": "F7", "corner": [200, 0], "width": 60, "height": 40},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "extrude",
    "profiles": [{"sketch": "F7", "region": "r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]}"}],
    "extent": {"type": "distance", "distance": 20}, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "shell", "body": "F8.b0",
    "faces": ["F8:end(r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]})"], "inside": 1, "outside": 1,
    "face_thicknesses": [{"faces": ["F8:start(r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]})"], "inside": 3, "outside": 2}]}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Shell3", "status": "ok", "body": "Body3", "volume": 19820}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "measure", "a": "Body3/F8:start(r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]})",
    "b": "Body3/F9:offset(F8:start(r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]}))"},
